{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2022-05-06 14:00:00', 'title': 'MARY LYNNE HEDLEY ELECTED TO LILLY BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS , MAY 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE:LLY) HAS ELECTED MARY LYNNE HEDLEY, PH.D., AS A NEW MEMBER, EFFECTIVE MAY 15, 2022.'}